 python3 (>= 3.11),
 python3-activitytrack (>= 0.9.6)
Description: ActivityTrack in the terminal, full screen
 ActivityTrack records the work of freelancers and technicians: activities,
 travels, pauses and to-dos, on the Android app, on a web server of one's
 own and on the PC.
 .
 activitytrack-tui shows the activities running and the Home list of the
 app in a full-screen terminal interface (curses): keys pause, stop and
 start activities and to-dos, popups choose the actions and the clients,
 the sync runs in the background. It is the same application as the
 desktop tray application and the command line, on the same data.
